    "summaries": [
      {
        "action_date": "2025-03-24",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Recognizing Community Organizations for Veteran Engagement and Recovery Act or the RECOVER Act</strong></p><p>This bill requires the Department of Veterans Affairs to implement a three-year pilot program to make grants to established non-profit mental health care providers to provide culturally competent, evidence-based mental health care for veterans.&nbsp;</p>",
